# What a target can't draw yet of what the gallery uses: the target, then the
# element as compiler/language/targets.hpp names it, a line each. The gallery's test
# fails while this differs from what's so, so it only ever gets shorter; a new
# target starts with everything here and is done when none of its lines are left.
# A terminal draws no pictures, so it can't show one on a card or a table's row, crop one in place,
# or copy, save or keep a picture of a collage, and it has no screen of its own to
# take a screenshot of.
terminal cards.picture
terminal collage.copy
terminal collage.crop
terminal collage.preview
terminal collage.save
terminal collage.screenshot
terminal table.picture
